cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PVFMM, please cite the software and both papers below: the preferred citation and Algorithm 967 (ACM TOMS) in references."
type: software
title: "PVFMM: Parallel Volume Fast Multipole Method"
authors:
  - given-names: Dhairya
    family-names: Malhotra
